    "description": "Public-health agencies increasingly connect climate policy with immediate reductions in air pollution, energy poverty and preventable illness.",
    "intro": "Public-health agencies increasingly connect climate policy with immediate reductions in air pollution, energy poverty and preventable illness.",
    "mission": "",
