    "description": "Cities receiving people displaced by repeated floods, drought or livelihood loss must plan housing and services before movement becomes an emergency.",
    "intro": "Cities receiving people displaced by repeated floods, drought or livelihood loss must plan housing and services before movement becomes an emergency.",
    "mission": "",
