    "description": "An evidence-led reading on fast fashion and hidden costs, examining competing claims, consequences and possible responses.",
    "intro": "An evidence-led reading on fast fashion and hidden costs, examining competing claims, consequences and possible responses.",
    "mission": "",
    "grammar": "",
